const doc=`# Notebook confirmation, drawing layout and editor value API checkpoint\n\nThe accepted goal remains every documented feature of all ten original products and improvements in speed, resource use, ease of use, compatibility and reliability. **Zero products satisfy that complete standard.** This checkpoint adds tested features and publishes exact failures, corrections, independent reviews and sources.\n\n## Installed behavior and reproduction\n\n| App | Added behavior | Focused installed checks | Remaining scope |\n|---|---|---:|---|\n| Notes | Accessible in-page notebook trash/restore confirmation; Cancel returns to the open note without attachment reads; drafts, request identity and late-response guards. |69/69 | Full sync/shared notebooks, purge semantics, original database/application/GUI and comparative quality. |\n| Sketch | Six alignments and two distributions; group expansion, signed lines/freehand/fractional geometry, Undo/Redo, Save/native document retention; explicit module route. |39/39 app +2/2 HTTP | Rotation, rendered/bound text, external arrow bindings, opaque/image editing, fonts, broad formats, full renderer and comparative quality. |\n| Editor | Source-assisted Position, Range and Selection library with selected option/helper/readonly/directional semantics. Four new files; existing editor README/client unchanged. |13/13 pure API | Client cursor/selection integration, extension host, broad editing, regex/multiline/replace/encoding and full workbench parity. |\n\nThe combined suite passed **${a.summary.pass}/${a.summary.tests}**, with0failures/skips/cancellations/unfinished tests. All720eligible source files matched before and after execution. [Exact run and sources](${prefix}/preservation-manifest.json), [current receipt](results/development-validation.json), [Notes69](results/notes-inline-installed-focus-20261013/preservation-manifest.json), [Sketch41](results/sketch-layout-installed-focus-20261013/preservation-manifest.json) and [Editor API13](results/editor-value-api-installed-focus-20261013/preservation-manifest.json) keep overlapping tests and separate source epochs explicit. The suite tests implemented contracts and selected helper comparisons; it does not establish all original behavior or comparative superiority.\n\nStart Studio with the existing package start command and use Notes or Sketch. Developers can import the API module and run its regression test as described in [the API guide](apps/editor/POSITION-RANGE-SELECTION.md). [Drawing scope](apps/sketch/README.md) and [notebook scope](apps/notes/README.md) describe their app contracts.\n\n## Negative evidence and independent review\n\nNotes retains its214-file author epoch,74-file negative review,229-file correction and49-file independent acceptance. The correction fixes a real extra attachment read after Cancel; the independent review passes22finite checks. The old native-confirmation browser stall is still a failed/incomplete historical attempt. An87-file actual corrected browser campaign passes8finite workflows with45total host requests, including31browser Notes API requests,3seed calls and3programmatic attachment-fixture calls;3Saves and3genuine held disk commits. It confirms one63-byte downloaded fixture on disk; upload remains unaccepted because the bridge permission blocked it. TwelveJPEG screenshots keep original.png aliases. The earlier17-file metadata addendum incorrectly named the214-file source epoch; a separate31-file qualification override and14-file independent review correct only those12strings. No frozen earlier bytes were rewritten. [Reviewed installation](results/notes-inline-reviewed-production-installation-20261013/preservation-manifest.json) and [source verifier](results/notes-inline-public-verifier-20261013/preservation-manifest.json) preserve868public core aliases and explicit local-only exclusions.\n\nSketch retains the277-file author epoch,111-file independent negative review,188-file precision correction and81-file acceptance. The initial author28groups matched1944integer/authored action pairs; independent fractional cases exposed exact floating-point differences. Baseline30groups had28pass/2fail, including23/24review and1755/2000seeded exact pairs. The corrected30/30 matched3968action pairs:1944+24+2000, with2976alignments and992distributions across3oracle preparations of7slices/8declarations from5units. The correction computes point extrema directly, without rounding or tolerances. A separate19-group review passes164action calls/140unique action pairs; these overlap retained replay cases and are not added to3968. Original selected bodies and mutation helpers execute with owned unrotated geometry, no-op binding, scene/time/random adapters. Fulloriginal application/renderer0. [Source-plan review](results/sketch-layout-reviewed-installation-20261013/source-plan-independent-review/preservation-manifest.json) pins the8app proposals,5path adapters and832core evidence aliases.\n\nThe actual Sketch browser campaign passes14finite workflows,68DOM observations,20HTTP/5API requests and9JPEG screenshots with normal owned cleanup. Download events/bridge delivery did not yield an accepted downloaded file; exact native-export HTTP bytes are a separate accepted check. Its private one-statement route adapter differs from the later production99-byte staticMap insertion. The production route campaign retains0/2initial,1/2after correcting an owned Host-test premise, and2/2after the real404fix. Encoded-dot fetch probes pass through URL normalization and do not establish arbitrary raw-wire handling. [Browser proof](apps/sketch/results/layout-followup/browser/frozen/validation.json.snapshot) and [route epochs](results/sketch-layout-reviewed-installation-20261013/shared-route/frozen/validation.json.snapshot) preserve those limits.\n\nEditor API retains319accepted correction files plus81independent review files and embedded historical145author/43negative epochs. Six helper instances defined with nonconstructible shorthand methods had differed from released semantics; regular function replacements fix those finite differences. Fresh9group review compares58pairs:38exact encoded values/library errors and20engine rejection types retaining raw messages, plus6descriptor controls. It preserves the nonstrict composed-script control and explicit strict ES-module composition. These compare selected library classes, not a running original editor. The installed13regression groups import only Node test/assert and the local module; no original dependency executes. [Guide](apps/editor/POSITION-RANGE-SELECTION.md), [full Microsoft MIT notice](apps/editor/position-range-selection.NOTICE.md) and [independent publication review](results/editor-value-api-publication-independent-review-20261013/preservation-manifest.json) bind475inert aliases/four additions. The root installer selected guide-proposal/frozen rather than the previously documented documentation-proposal-override prefix; the focused recorder preserves that first source-gate failure and one-string adapter before its separate passing13run.\n\n## Preservation and current source boundaries\n\n[The prior3baecf4e public checkpoint](results/milestones/search-trash-recycle-save-3baecf4e-20261013/snapshot-manifest.json) retains709source and14metadata identities. Its811check receipt remains historical. Old34Notes/Vault installation rows resolve six replaced Notes paths through exact before snapshots, while28paths still match current bytes. The prior Editor31-source/browser receipts now have exactly one explicit host change:7741bytes/807a… to7840bytes/85fe…, reconstructed by one99-byte route insertion. All30other named sources stay exact. These historical browser records are not relabeled as fresh whole-host browser acceptance. [Root14-file installation](results/editor-sketch-reviewed-production-installation-20261013/preservation-manifest.json) binds1307exact inert copies,3before images and11additions/3replacements; installation itself executes no tests/originals/browser.\n\nLocal synthetic JEX/KDBX carriers and generated private mirrors stay excluded by explicit records. Official source licenses/headers remain with the retained artifacts. All159original source-ID/SHA pairs and232capability IDs remain intact. Missing feature denominators, full release/edition bindings, benchmarks, usability, security and long-run reliability gates remain open; Metrics regressions and four unaccepted trials are unchanged. The next implementation continues whole-word/regex search and other missing release-bound contracts. No complete-product notification is warranted.\n`;
fs.writeFileSync(path.join(studio,'NOTES-LAYOUT-VALUE-API-MILESTONE.md'),doc,{flag:'wx'});for(const [p,isRoot]of [[path.join(lab,'README.md'),true],[path.join(studio,'README.md'),false]]){let t=fs.readFileSync(p,'utf8');if(isRoot)t=t.replace('The current [search, Save, notebook trash and entry recycling checkpoint]','The historical [search, Save, notebook trash and entry recycling checkpoint]');else t=t.replace('The current record contains **811 passing tests and 0 skips**, with709 unchanged source fingerprints.',`The current record contains **${a.summary.pass} passing tests and0skips**, with720unchanged source fingerprints.`).replace('The [current search/Save/trash/recycle study]','The historical [search/Save/trash/recycle study]').replace('binds the latest current suite and exact source/negative/independent evidence. The current Notes native confirmation browser attempt is incomplete; the new in-page confirmation is a separate development stage.','binds the earlier3ba suite and exact source/negative/independent evidence. Its native confirmation browser attempt remains incomplete; the later in-page confirmation is now installed and tested.');t=t.replace('[Current Editor browser acceptance]','[Prior source-bound Editor browser acceptance]').replace('with 31 exact current source identities','with31 exact named source identities from before the later Sketch host-route insertion');t+=`\nThe current [notebook confirmation, drawing layout and editor value API checkpoint](${isRoot?'products/rea-studio/':''}NOTES-LAYOUT-VALUE-API-MILESTONE.md) passes **${a.summary.pass} implemented-contract checks,0skips and720stable source fingerprints**. Notes passes69focused checks and8browser groups; Sketch39app/2HTTP checks and14browser groups; Editor API13pure checks. Source snapshots, confirmed failures, strictness/precision corrections, independent review and exact historical host transitions remain inspectable. Zero products satisfy the accepted complete replacement and comparative standard.\n`;fs.writeFileSync(p,t);}
const regs=['workspace-products.json','visual-products.json','system-products.json'];function project(j,n){return{sources:j.sources.map(s=>({id:s.id,sha256:s.sha256})),capabilities:n==='system-products.json'?j.products.flatMap(p=>p.capabilities.map(c=>c.id)):n==='workspace-products.json'?j.capabilities.map(c=>c.id):j.baselineProducts.flatMap(p=>p.requirements.map(c=>c.id))};}const old=regs.map(n=>project(read(path.join(studio,'requirements',n)),n));for(const n of ['workspace-products.json','visual-products.json']){const p=path.join(studio,'requirements',n),j=read(p);j.currentNotesLayoutValueApiMilestone={record:'products/rea-studio/NOTES-LAYOUT-VALUE-API-MILESTONE.md',currentCombinedTests:a.summary.pass,currentCombinedSources:720,notesFocused:69,sketchFocused:39,sketchSharedRouteHTTP:2,editorValueApiPure:13,fullDocumentationInventoryClosed:false,originalSourceIdentitiesPreserved:true,capabilityIdsPreserved:true,completeProducts:0};fs.writeFileSync(p,JSON.stringify(j,null,2)+'\n');}assert.deepEqual(regs.map(n=>project(read(path.join(studio,'requirements',n)),n)),old);const rp=path.join(studio,'requirements/README.md');fs.appendFileSync(rp,`\nThe current [Notes/layout/value-API checkpoint](../NOTES-LAYOUT-VALUE-API-MILESTONE.md) adds finite installed evidence while preserving159original source-ID/SHA pairs and232capability IDs. The release-bound exhaustive atomic feature inventory and all full-product comparison gates remain open.\n`);console.log(JSON.stringify({passed:a.summary.pass,sources:720,snapshots:snapshots.length,preservationSHA256:sha(mb),developmentSHA256:sha(db),completeProducts:0}));
